        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Upgrades:</strong> 0</p><hr /><p>The caramel cannon shoots globs of sticky caramel. When you Area Fire this weapon, instead of dealing damage, you create difficult terrain in the affected area that lasts for 2 rounds. If you're trained with this weapon, creatures in the area that fail their Reflex saves treat the area as greater difficult terrain (and become @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Immobilized] on a critical failure). Creatures can attempt to Escape against your class DC to remove the immobilized condition. If you have the primary target class feature, you can attempt to [[/act grapple]] your primary target instead of Strike (with a –2 circumstance penalty, as normal for the ranged grapple trait).</p>"
